re you that I will stay available online and ensure all\nresponsibilities are managed without any disruption.\n\nThank you for your understanding and support.\n\nSincerely,\nYashwanth Raj\nEtherX Innovations Pvt Ltd\n\n--000000000000947bce0659c6cf7d\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\n\n&lt;div dir=3D&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class=3D&quot;gmail_quote gmail_quote_container&quot;&gt;&lt;=\ndiv dir=3D&quot;ltr&quot; class=3D&quot;gmail_attr&quot;&gt;---------- Forwarded message ---------=\n&lt;br&gt;From: &lt;strong class=3D&quot;gmail_sendername&quot; dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Yashwanth&lt;/strong=\n&gt; &lt;span dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;a href=3D&quot;mailto:yashwanthrajdj33@gmail.com&quot;&gt;yash=\nwanthrajdj33@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Date: Fri, Dec 19, 2025 at 6:54=E2=\n=80=AFPM&lt;br&gt;Subject: Leave Request for internals , as well as work from hom=\ne on Saturday (Tommorow)&lt;br&gt;To:  &amp;lt;&lt;a href=3D&quot;mailto:hretherxinnovations@=\ngmail.com&quot;&gt;hretherxinnovations@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div dir=\n=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Dear Sir/Madam,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;I hope t=\nhis message finds you well.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;I would like to inform y=\nou that I have my internal examinations scheduled from Monday to Wednesday.=\n Hence, I kindly request leave for the mentioned days.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;aut=\no&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Additionally, I would like to request Work F=\nrom Home for tomorrow (Saturday) so that I can effectively focus on my assi=\ngned work at EtherX Innovations Pvt Ltd while also preparing for my examina=\ntions from home.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;I assur=\ne you that I will stay available online and ensure all responsibilities are=\n managed without any disruption.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=\n=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Thank you for your understanding and support.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;au=\nto&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Sincerely,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Yashwanth=\n Raj&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=3D&quot;auto&quot;&gt;EtherX Innovations Pvt Ltd&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n--000000000000947bce0659c6cf7d--</pre></div></div></div></body></html> ","from":""}␀␀␀–¬Õ"|␀␀␀ê'u#|␀␀␀êIŒ"|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀p‘v#|␀␀␀0gr&|␀␀␀‡®G#|␀␀␀¿0v#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀∞ì´#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀∞4l&|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀FÕ"|␀␀␀∞.±#|␀␀␀¿ÄD#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀‡”v#|␀␀␀–l&|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀0πD#|␀␀␀`	æ#|␀␀␀`Ì∑#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀PqÕ"|␀␀␀–)æ#|␀␀␀␀íx#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀–ct#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀†Øu#|␀␀␀–Ã"|␀␀␀‡:@#|␀␀␀3l&|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ Mt#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ê*Ã"|␀␀␀Ä¢y#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀|t#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀0·Õ"|␀␀␀êèD#|␀␀␀–î´#|␀␀␀@ãG#|␀␀␀¿õx#|␀␀␀Pœ"|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀–ÈÕ"|␀␀␀¨D#|␀␀␀0èy#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀]z#|␀␀␀P˝i&|␀␀␀†æ#|␀␀␀⁄Õ"|␀␀␀pQr&|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀RŒ"|␀␀␀ Ã"|␀␀␀¿$B#|␀␀␀–⁄w#|␀␀␀PwÕ"|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Äbf&|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀êïD#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Äç≠#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀˚∑#|␀␀␀ππ#|␀␀␀Ä÷s#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀†‡Õ"|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀–l&|␀␀␀ l&|␀␀␀∞Ys#|␀␀␀ l&|␀␀␀ Æ´#|␀␀␀‡4B#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀@l|&|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀‡"F#|␀␀␀F#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀p»Õ"|␀␀␀ ´G#|␀␀␀@ @#|␀␀␀êºπ#|␀␀␀péx#|␀␀␀!±#|␀␀␀of&|␀␀␀`l&|␀␀␀ l&|␀␀␀p|&|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ff&|␀␀␀@∏π#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀∞F#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀P÷i&|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ (F#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¿™x#|␀␀␀`␀©#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀0@#|␀␀␀`3B#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀pŒ"|␀␀␀*±#|␀␀␀0<©#|␀␀␀êFf&|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀†Ê∑#|␀␀␀–Wf&|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀p±#|␀␀␀∞∫π#|␀␀␀‡®´#|␀␀␀–xt#|␀␀␀␀6@#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀`3©#|␀␀␀p»s#|␀␀␀¿OŒ"|␀␀␀P(±#|␀␀␀p#æ#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ãw#|␀␀␀ y#|␀␀␀Çy#|␀␀␀P(Ã"|␀␀␀0ÉD#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ä:F#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀†;©#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀≥G#|␀␀␀PAh&|␀␀␀@ v#|␀␀␀†Ã"|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀PSs#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀“v#|␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀